{"verse_key": "10:51", "surah": 10, "verse": 51, "text_uthmani": "أَثُمَّ إِذَا مَا وَقَعَ ءَامَنتُم بِهِۦٓ ۚ ءَآلْـَٔـٰنَ وَقَدْ كُنتُم بِهِۦ تَسْتَعْجِلُونَ", "translation": "Then is it that when it has [actually] occurred you will believe in it? Now?<sup foot_note=196449>1</sup> And you were [once] for it impatient.<sup foot_note=196448>2</sup>", "verse_from_ms": 1191780, "verse_to_ms": 1209360, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "أَثُمَّ", "start_ms": 1191780, "end_ms": 1193250}, {"i": 1, "text": "إِذَا", "start_ms": 1193250, "end_ms": 1193820}, {"i": 2, "text": "مَا", "start_ms": 1193820, "end_ms": 1194210}, {"i": 3, "text": "وَقَعَ", "start_ms": 1194210, "end_ms": 1194870}, {"i": 4, "text": "ءَامَنتُم", "start_ms": 1194870, "end_ms": 1197410}, {"i": 5, "text": "بِهِۦٓ", "start_ms": 1197410, "end_ms": 1198580}, {"i": 6, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 1198580, "end_ms": 1202089}, {"i": 7, "text": "ءَآلْـَٔـٰنَ", "start_ms": 1202090, "end_ms": 1202700}, {"i": 8, "text": "وَقَدْ", "start_ms": 1202700, "end_ms": 1205160}, {"i": 9, "text": "كُنتُم", "start_ms": 1205160, "end_ms": 1205690}, {"i": 10, "text": "بِهِۦ", "start_ms": 1205690, "end_ms": 1208795}, {"i": 11, "text": "تَسْتَعْجِلُونَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}